t_block_delta events, so target may be undefined at observation time for streaming inputs. Accepted design limitation, pre-existing in the terminal display path.","line":496}]},"followUpAttempts":0,"transientRetryAttempts":0,"addedTurns":{"reportRetry":0,"postWork":0,"outputRepair":0}},"startedAt":"2026-08-14T16:39:43.012Z","endedAt":"2026-08-14T16:45:46.698Z","commitOid":"904a556e8d2188efdde983e8efd97842b77d061d"}
